  "templates": [
    {
      "pat": "An ENTRY is all data pertaining to a particular structure deposited in the PDB and is designated with a 4-character alphanumeric identifier called the PDB identifier or PDB ID (e.g. {{1}}).",
      "zh": "ENTRY（条目）是指与 PDB 中存放的某个特定结构相关的全部数据，并用一个 4 个字符的字母数字标识符来标记，称为 PDB 标识符或 PDB ID（例如{{1}}）。"
    },
    {
      "pat": "Since there can be multiple INSTANCES of a given ENTITY in the ENTRY, each INSTANCE of polymer or branched ENTITY is given a unique chain identifier or chain ID (of one or more alphanumeric characters; e.g., A, AA, ...). Chain IDs provide an easy way to refer to, select, and display every specific INSTANCE of each polymer and branched ENTITY. However, there is no specific rationale for assignment of chain IDs. Therefore, chain IDs assigned to an ENTITY in two different ENTRIES of the same protein may be different. Learn more about the identifiers {{1}}.",
      "zh": "由于一个 ENTRY 中可以存在同一 ENTITY 的多个 INSTANCE，每个聚合物或分支 ENTITY 的 INSTANCE 都会被赋予唯一的链标识符或链 ID（由一到多个字母数字字符组成；例如 A、AA、……）。链 ID 提供了一种简便的方式，用来引用、选择和显示每个聚合物及分支 ENTITY 的每一个具体 INSTANCE。不过，链 ID 的分配并没有特定的依据。因此，同一蛋白质在两个不同 ENTRY 中被赋予的 ENTITY 链 ID 可能不同。{{1}}了解更多关于标识符的信息。"
    },
